Maybe per-record field should be `encrypted: bool` meaning "the SMB session used encryption" rather than "this record was carried encrypted". Document accordingly.

Could also add `SMB::State$encrypted` and a new event `smb2_encrypted` emitted once when encryption first seen. Then users can react. But existing `smb2_transform_header` serves.

